('hptdc-hotel-bhagsu-mcleod-ganj', 'HPTDC Hotel Bhagsu', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'The Bhagsu is run by the Himachal Pradesh Tourism Development Corporation and has been receiving guests since 1978, which makes it one of the oldest established hotels in McLeod Ganj. Unlike most places in this crowded hill town, it has real breathing space: the buildings sit within a large plot of lawns and tall deodars, with the Dhauladhar ridge as a backdrop. Rooms come in deluxe and suite categories, and there are also separate huts on the grounds.

It suits families, older travellers and anyone who prefers a dependable government-run hotel with a restaurant, bar and parking over a boutique stay. The location is the big advantage: Tsuglagkhang, Namgyal Monastery and the Tibetan market lanes are all walkable, so you can leave the car parked for the whole stay. Bookings can be made through the HPTDC website, which is also the best place to check current room categories.', 'Himachal Tourism''s long-running McLeod Ganj hotel, set in deodar-shaded lawns a short walk from the Dalai Lama temple and the main market.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Central McLeod Ganj, close to the Temple Road side of town', 'Central McLeod Ganj, close to the Temple Road side of town', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Restaurant","Bar","Parking","Room service","Laundry service","Taxi on request","Mountain views","LED TV","Satellite TV","Intercom","Taxi on demand","Card payments accepted"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://hptdc.hp.gov.in/public/uploads/hotel_images/1765786642_693fc4123496d_Hotel%20Bhagsu%20Mcleodganj.jpg","alt":"Main building and garden pathway at HPTDC Hotel Bhagsu, McLeod Ganj","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://hptdc.hp.gov.in/public/uploads/hotel_images/1765786642_693fc412354e4_Huts.jpg","alt":"Lawns, deodar trees and garden huts at HPTDC Hotel Bhagsu, McLeod Ganj","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://hptdc.hp.gov.in/public/uploads/hotel_images/1765786658_693fc422b6a53_Deluxe%20room.jpg","alt":"Deluxe room with wooden floor at HPTDC Hotel Bhagsu, McLeod Ganj","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://hptdc.hp.gov.in/public/uploads/hotel_images/1765786658_693fc422b8015_Suite%20room.jpg","alt":"Suite room with sitting area and TV at HPTDC Hotel Bhagsu, McLeod Ganj","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3}]'::jsonb, '[{"name":"Deluxe Room","description":"Deluxe category room in the main hotel building.","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Suite","description":"Larger suite room with a sitting area.","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Hut","description":"Separate cottage-style hut set on the lawns within the hotel grounds.","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true}]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is HPTDC Hotel Bhagsu located?","answer":"HPTDC Hotel Bhagsu is in Central McLeod Ganj, close to the Temple Road side of town. Nearby: Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- about 10 min walk; McLeod Ganj main square -- about 5 min walk."},{"question":"Who is HPTDC Hotel Bhagsu best for?","answer":"It suits families, senior travellers, pilgrims and culture seekers. See other stays in McLeod Ganj if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for HPTDC Hotel Bhagsu?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in McLeod Ganj."}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'mid-range', '["Operated by Himachal Tourism (HPTDC) since 1978","Spacious grounds with lawns and deodar trees","Choice of rooms, suites and garden huts","Walking distance to the Dalai Lama temple complex"]'::jsonb, '["Families","Senior travellers","Pilgrims and culture seekers"]'::jsonb, '["Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- about 10 min walk","McLeod Ganj main square -- about 5 min walk","Tibetan market lanes -- 5 min walk","Bhagsunag Temple -- about 2 km"]'::jsonb, 'https://hptdc.hp.gov.in/hotel-detail/25', 'https://hptdc.hp.gov.in/hotel-detail/25', 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://hptdc.hp.gov.in/hotel-detail/25 , https://wanderlog.com/place/details/1931804/hptdc-hotel-bhagsu', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('green-hotel-bhagsu-road-mcleod-ganj', 'Green Hotel', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'Green Hotel is one of those McLeod Ganj addresses that travellers have been recommending to each other for years. It is a modest, no-frills hotel of a little over twenty rooms on Bhagsu Road, a few minutes on foot from the main square. The rooms are plain and practical, but each has a balcony with a view out over the valley and hills, which is the main reason people keep coming back.

It works best for independent travellers, couples and volunteers who want a clean, central base and plan to eat out in the many cafes nearby. Note that the in-house restaurant has been listed as under renovation, so do not count on meals on site. Being on a busy road, some rooms pick up street noise, and hot water pressure can vary in peak season, so ask for a room away from the road if you are a light sleeper.', 'A long-standing budget favourite on Bhagsu Road with simple balcony rooms looking out over the valley, minutes from the main square.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Bhagsu Road, McLeod Ganj', 'Bhagsu Road, McLeod Ganj', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Balconies","Mountain views","Laundry","Airport shuttle","Balcony","Mountain view"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/61501863.jpg?k=bdda5c528bc89dc1e33e38c7aa37a8b18c6840aff85d91f02db2b55c64f82cce","alt":"Building with balcony corridors and garden at Green Hotel, Bhagsu Road, McLeod Ganj","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/492876864.jpg?k=dea0ca1bb204f20f8293de2777c4e605da7f376e749f70926e4511ac51a51a3c","alt":"Double room with balcony door at Green Hotel, McLeod Ganj","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/60401421.jpg?k=de871504dcedf60760aedf5f1dc33591458fab2801f795b404b0a6a37fe89e0c","alt":"Double room with chairs by the window at Green Hotel, McLeod Ganj","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/60401428.jpg?k=d93d6be2cccb8e95d83d9be77a42320c7cc301526cfa2377ca6d0b50004914a2","alt":"Double bedroom with large window at Green Hotel, McLeod Ganj","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/60401439.jpg?k=b2c16417bf977f46a739598a5fd5b90ae1543bdf07f81e695be47a4415befa23","alt":"Double room with orange feature wall at Green Hotel, McLeod Ganj","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4},{"url":"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/61389709.jpg?k=77ccdcd627a0e7b2295501f26897fe99cda92204cad46a9cb53423ae6b9993cd","alt":"Room with double bed and sitting area at Green Hotel, McLeod Ganj","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":5},{"url":"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/60401319.jpg?k=f8097570ee9e63d1def5beeabb59f318eac1f656aabee61d78cb410e90c24795","alt":"Twin-bed room at Green Hotel, McLeod Ganj","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":6},{"url":"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/60401438.jpg?k=3d4c095804cf489cfeb71eaf1e687ab567ca1d1802b35b2297e42992edd0dcd1","alt":"Attached bathroom with water heater at Green Hotel, McLeod Ganj","category":"bathroom","is_primary":false,"sort_order":7},{"url":"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/60401425.jpg?k=f05044abaf959d1d07a465871a98ab8d33a1d045cd18bd953f33a402e29ecad6","alt":"View over McLeod Ganj and the forested hills from Green Hotel","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":8},{"url":"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/60401434.jpg?k=3cd885f66448664951073c5f37e0d1af1903db526998c38b2e4228c9d8b6f446","alt":"Valley view from Green Hotel, McLeod Ganj","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":9}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is Green Hotel located?","answer":"Green Hotel is in Bhagsu Road, McLeod Ganj. Nearby: McLeod Ganj main square -- about 5 min walk; Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- about 15 min walk."},{"question":"What are the check-in and check-out times at Green Hotel?","answer":"Check-in is from 13:30 and check-out is by 12:00. Confirm early check-in or late check-out when you enquire."},{"question":"Who is Green Hotel best for?","answer":"It suits budget travellers, couples, solo travellers. See other stays in McLeod Ganj if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for Green Hotel?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in McLeod Ganj."}]'::jsonb, '13:30', '12:00', 'Pets are not allowed.', NULL, NULL, 'budget', '["Every room has a balcony with mountain or valley views","Central location on Bhagsu Road","Long-established budget favourite","Free WiFi in rooms"]'::jsonb, '["Budget travellers","Couples","Solo travellers"]'::jsonb, '["McLeod Ganj main square -- about 5 min walk","Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- about 15 min walk","Bhagsunag Temple and waterfall -- about 25 min walk","McLeod Ganj bus stand -- about 5 min walk"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'https://www.booking.com/hotel/in/green-dharamshala.html', 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://ae.trip.com/hotels/kangra-hotel-detail-71957177/green-hotel , https://www.kayak.com/Dharamsala-Hotels-Green-Hotel.877415.ksp', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('hotel-tibet-mcleod-ganj', 'Hotel Tibet', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'Hotel Tibet is a Tibetan-owned hotel run as part of a community enterprise, and it sits right in the thick of McLeod Ganj, a stone''s throw from the main square. The rooms are on the older side but roomy, with Tibetan patterns and colours brightening up otherwise straightforward furnishings, and some look out towards the mountains.

The ground-floor Tibet Restaurant is a draw in itself, serving momos, thukpa and other Tibetan and Asian dishes, and breakfast is served there for hotel guests. The hotel suits travellers who want to be in the middle of the action, with the temple, monasteries, cafes and shops all within walking distance, and who value location and atmosphere over polish. Reviews are mixed on upkeep and service speed, so it is worth checking the room before you settle in, but the staff are often praised for being warm and full of local tips.', 'A Tibetan-run hotel in the heart of McLeod Ganj with a well-known in-house Tibetan restaurant and easy access to everything on foot.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Bhagsunag Road, near the main square, McLeod Ganj', 'Bhagsunag Road, near the main square, McLeod Ganj', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["Restaurant","Breakfast available","Mountain views","Rooftop restaurant","Bar","Bakery","Cable TV","Telephone","Hot water","Banquet hall","Board room"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://www.nyamdel.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/IMG_6341-e1671981697593.jpg","alt":"Hotel Tibet Bakery shopfront at Hotel Tibet, McLeod Ganj","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://www.nyamdel.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/IMG_6616.jpg","alt":"Entrance to the bar and restaurant at Hotel Tibet, McLeod Ganj","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://www.nyamdel.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/IMG_6596.jpg","alt":"Room with double bed and sitting area at Hotel Tibet, McLeod Ganj","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://www.nyamdel.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/IMG_6498.jpg","alt":"Twin room with Tibetan bedspreads at Hotel Tibet, McLeod Ganj","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://www.nyamdel.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/IMG_6517.jpg","alt":"Room with balcony door at Hotel Tibet, McLeod Ganj","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4},{"url":"https://www.nyamdel.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/IMG_6573.jpg","alt":"Twin room with window view at Hotel Tibet, McLeod Ganj","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":5},{"url":"https://www.nyamdel.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/IMG_6530.jpg","alt":"Attached bathroom at Hotel Tibet, McLeod Ganj","category":"bathroom","is_primary":false,"sort_order":6},{"url":"https://www.nyamdel.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/IMG_6581.jpg","alt":"Balcony view towards the hills from Hotel Tibet, McLeod Ganj","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":7},{"url":"https://www.nyamdel.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/IMG_6284.jpg","alt":"Restaurant dining hall at Hotel Tibet, McLeod Ganj","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":8},{"url":"https://www.nyamdel.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/IMG_6329.jpg","alt":"Bar and lounge seating at Hotel Tibet, McLeod Ganj","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":9},{"url":"https://www.nyamdel.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/IMG_6618.jpg","alt":"Reception lobby seating at Hotel Tibet, McLeod Ganj","category":"lobby","is_primary":false,"sort_order":10},{"url":"https://www.nyamdel.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/IMG_6473.jpg","alt":"Banquet hall at Hotel Tibet, McLeod Ganj","category":"amenity","is_primary":false,"sort_order":11}]'::jsonb, '[{"name":"Standard Double","description":"Entry-level double room with attached bathroom.","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Semi-Deluxe Double","description":"Mid-category double room with attached bathroom.","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Deluxe Double","description":"Top-category double room with attached bathroom.","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true}]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is Hotel Tibet located?","answer":"Hotel Tibet is in Bhagsunag Road, near the main square, McLeod Ganj. Nearby: McLeod Ganj main square -- 2 min walk; Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- about 10 min walk."},{"question":"Who is Hotel Tibet best for?","answer":"It suits culture seekers, groups, first-time visitors. See other stays in McLeod Ganj if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for Hotel Tibet?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in McLeod Ganj."}]'::jsonb, NULL, '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'mid-range', '["Tibetan-run hotel in central McLeod Ganj","In-house restaurant known for Tibetan food","Rooms with Tibetan design touches","Everything in town reachable on foot"]'::jsonb, '["Culture seekers","Groups","First-time visitors"]'::jsonb, '["McLeod Ganj main square -- 2 min walk","Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- about 10 min walk","McLeod Ganj bus stand -- 2 min walk","Bhagsunag Temple -- about 2 km"]'::jsonb, 'http://www.nyamdel.com/', 'https://www.nyamdel.com/shop-now/hotels/hotel-tibet-dharamshala/', 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://wanderlog.com/place/details/1739534/hotel-tibet-dhasa , http://www.nyamdel.com/', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('backpackers-inn-jogiwara-road-mcleod-ganj', 'Backpackers Inn McLeodganj', 'guesthouse', 'published', 'directory', 'Despite the name, Backpackers Inn is a small guesthouse with private rooms rather than a dorm hostel. It sits on Jogiwara Road, below Hotel Mount View, about half a kilometre from the Dalai Lama temple and the Tibetan market, so most of McLeod Ganj is an easy walk away. Rooms have their own bathrooms, heating for the colder months and balconies, and many look straight down the valley towards the plains.

The owner and staff get consistently warm mentions from guests, and the team can help arrange local tours and onward travel. There is a rooftop restaurant serving Indian food, handy on rainy evenings. It suits solo travellers, couples and budget-minded visitors who want a private room and a sociable, helpful host rather than hotel formality. Jogiwara Road is steep in places, so pack light if you plan to walk up from the bus stand.', 'A friendly, budget guesthouse on Jogiwara Road with private rooms, balconies with valley views and a rooftop restaurant.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Jogiwara Road, McLeod Ganj', 'Jogiwara Road, McLeod Ganj', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Restaurant","Heating","Travel desk","Luggage storage","Mountain views","24-hour reception","Currency exchange","Shuttle bus","Rooftop cafe"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/q_auto,w_1200,c_limit/propertyimages/1/101756/qerihdc3qggdxpoj2gix.jpg","alt":"Terrace and building front at Backpackers Inn, Jogiwara Road, McLeod Ganj","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/q_auto,w_1200,c_limit/propertyimages/1/101756/xnlpqsw0x2vmsl7bwnw2.jpg","alt":"Private double room with mountain-view windows at Backpackers Inn, McLeod Ganj","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/q_auto,w_1200,c_limit/propertyimages/1/101756/tfpnfsm5hjtdbwm3e72r.jpg","alt":"Private room with valley-view window at Backpackers Inn, McLeod Ganj","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/q_auto,w_1200,c_limit/propertyimages/1/101756/urh5ifjh6yuj0cbfgbsc.jpg","alt":"Attached bathroom with water heater at Backpackers Inn, McLeod Ganj","category":"bathroom","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/q_auto,w_1200,c_limit/propertyimages/1/101756/wfijicgu7xofqksf1nyt.jpg","alt":"Painted cafe and lounge at Backpackers Inn, McLeod Ganj","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/q_auto,w_1200,c_limit/propertyimages/1/101756/nnn4iekm0ac5rlmt949a.jpg","alt":"Mural-painted dining room at Backpackers Inn, McLeod Ganj","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":5},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/q_auto,w_1200,c_limit/propertyimages/1/101756/bhl2ayjqljrly3ywe2w8.jpg","alt":"Rooftop cafe seating with mountain view at Backpackers Inn, McLeod Ganj","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":6},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/q_auto,w_1200,c_limit/propertyimages/1/101756/bxe9kxrd3uby9i3grnne.jpg","alt":"Rooftop terrace with plants and signboard at Backpackers Inn, McLeod Ganj","category":"amenity","is_primary":false,"sort_order":7},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/q_auto,w_1200,c_limit/propertyimages/1/101756/x96vriblwnmish6uz3l2.jpg","alt":"Terrace view over the McLeod Ganj hillside from Backpackers Inn","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":8},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/q_auto,w_1200,c_limit/propertyimages/1/101756/aa1yobutwezdvtltomxm.jpg","alt":"Sunset over the hills from the rooftop at Backpackers Inn, McLeod Ganj","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":9}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is Backpackers Inn McLeodganj located?","answer":"Backpackers Inn McLeodganj is in Jogiwara Road, McLeod Ganj. Nearby: Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- about 500 m; Tibetan market -- about 500 m."},{"question":"What are the check-in and check-out times at Backpackers Inn McLeodganj?","answer":"Check-in is from 12:00. Confirm early check-in or late check-out when you enquire."},{"question":"Who is Backpackers Inn McLeodganj best for?","answer":"It suits solo travellers, budget travellers, couples. See other stays in McLeod Ganj if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for Backpackers Inn McLeodganj?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in McLeod Ganj."}]'::jsonb, '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'budget', '["Private rooms with attached bathrooms and balconies","Valley and mountain views","Rooftop restaurant","Helpful travel desk"]'::jsonb, '["Solo travellers","Budget travellers","Couples"]'::jsonb, '["Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- about 500 m","Tibetan market -- about 500 m","McLeod Ganj main square -- about 10 min walk","Dharamshala (Kotwali Bazaar) -- about 25 min by taxi"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'https://www.hostelworld.com/hostels/p/101756/backpackers-inn-mcleodganj/', 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://www.hostelworld.com/hostels/p/101756/backpackers-inn-mcleodganj/ , https://www.expedia.com/Dharamshala-Hotels-Hotel-Bacpacker-Inn.h120475762.Hotel-Information', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('the-belvedere-himalayan-retreat-mcleod-ganj', 'The Belvedere Himalayan Retreat', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'The Belvedere is part of the Leisure Hotels group and occupies a handy spot in McLeod Ganj, roughly 100 metres from Mall Road and about 200 metres from the Dalai Lama temple complex. That puts the main monastery, the Tibetan market and the town''s cafes within a few minutes on foot, while the hotel itself feels a little removed from the bustle.

There are several room categories, and it is worth paying attention to the details: the entry-level rooms have no view, while the superior rooms and suites come with balconies facing the Dhauladhar range. A multi-cuisine restaurant mixes international dishes with Himachali specialities, and there is a bar for the evenings. It is a sensible choice for couples and families who want hotel comforts and a central address, and it can also handle small events and meetings.', 'A comfortable Leisure Hotels property tucked just off Mall Road, a short stroll from the Dalai Lama temple, with mountain-facing balcony rooms.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Near Mall Road, McLeod Ganj', 'Near Mall Road, McLeod Ganj', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["Restaurant","Bar","Mountain views","Event space","WiFi","Minibar","Tea/coffee maker","In-room safe","55-inch TV","Temperature control","Balcony","Mountain view","Conference facilities"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://assets.simplotel.com/simplotel/image/upload/q_80,w_1600,c_limit/the-belvedere-himalayan-retreat-mcleodganj/DJI_0874-2.jpg","alt":"The Belvedere Himalayan Retreat building among deodar forest, McLeod Ganj","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://assets.simplotel.com/simplotel/image/upload/q_80,w_1600,c_limit/the-belvedere-himalayan-retreat-mcleodganj/Facade_1_q11d7k.jpg","alt":"Facade and forecourt of The Belvedere Himalayan Retreat, McLeod Ganj","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://assets.simplotel.com/simplotel/image/upload/q_80,w_1600,c_limit/the-belvedere-himalayan-retreat-mcleodganj/Superior_room_at_belvedere_witha_view_ikt4px.jpg","alt":"Superior Room with balcony at The Belvedere Himalayan Retreat, McLeod Ganj","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://assets.simplotel.com/simplotel/image/upload/q_80,w_1600,c_limit/the-belvedere-himalayan-retreat-mcleodganj/Suite_13_fawaey.jpg","alt":"Suite bedroom with balcony and mountain view at The Belvedere Himalayan Retreat, McLeod Ganj","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://assets.simplotel.com/simplotel/image/upload/q_80,w_1600,c_limit/the-belvedere-himalayan-retreat-mcleodganj/seating_space_inside_the_suite_t6osx6.jpg","alt":"Seating area inside a suite at The Belvedere Himalayan Retreat, McLeod Ganj","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4},{"url":"https://assets.simplotel.com/simplotel/image/upload/q_80,w_1600,c_limit/the-belvedere-himalayan-retreat-mcleodganj/Family_Room_6_olmtwn.jpg","alt":"Family Room with minibar and work desk at The Belvedere Himalayan Retreat, McLeod Ganj","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":5},{"url":"https://assets.simplotel.com/simplotel/image/upload/q_80,w_1600,c_limit/the-belvedere-himalayan-retreat-mcleodganj/Suite_23_zvveod.jpg","alt":"Suite balcony overlooking the Dhauladhar range at The Belvedere Himalayan Retreat, McLeod Ganj","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":6},{"url":"https://assets.simplotel.com/simplotel/image/upload/q_80,w_1600,c_limit/the-belvedere-himalayan-retreat-mcleodganj/IMG_4334-HDR.jpg","alt":"Multi-cuisine restaurant at The Belvedere Himalayan Retreat, McLeod Ganj","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":7},{"url":"https://assets.simplotel.com/simplotel/image/upload/q_80,w_1600,c_limit/the-belvedere-himalayan-retreat-mcleodganj/dining_at_the_belvedere.jpg","alt":"Buffet counter in the restaurant at The Belvedere Himalayan Retreat, McLeod Ganj","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":8}]'::jsonb, '[{"name":"Deluxe Room (No View)","description":"300 sq ft room without a view.","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Superior Room with Balcony","description":"300 sq ft room with a balcony facing the Dhauladhar mountains.","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Family Room (No View)","description":"Larger 480 sq ft room, without a view.","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Suite with Balcony","description":"752 sq ft suite with balcony and mountain views.","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":3,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true}]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is The Belvedere Himalayan Retreat located?","answer":"The Belvedere Himalayan Retreat is in Near Mall Road, McLeod Ganj. Nearby: Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- about 200 m; Mall Road -- about 100 m."},{"question":"What are the check-in and check-out times at The Belvedere Himalayan Retreat?","answer":"Check-in is from 13:00 and check-out is by 11:00. Confirm early check-in or late check-out when you enquire."},{"question":"Who is The Belvedere Himalayan Retreat best for?","answer":"It suits couples, families, small groups. See other stays in McLeod Ganj if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for The Belvedere Himalayan Retreat?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in McLeod Ganj."}]'::jsonb, '13:00', '11:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'mid-range', '["About 200 m from the Dalai Lama temple complex","Balcony rooms and suites facing the Dhauladhar","Restaurant serving international and Himachali food","Bar on site"]'::jsonb, '["Couples","Families","Small groups"]'::jsonb, '["Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- about 200 m","Mall Road -- about 100 m","Namgyal Monastery -- about 5 min walk","Dal Lake and Naddi -- about 15 min drive"]'::jsonb, 'https://www.leisurehotels.co.in/mcleodganj/belvedere-himalayan-retreat/faqs.html', 'https://www.leisurehotels.co.in/mcleodganj/belvedere-himalayan-retreat/', 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://www.leisurehotels.co.in/mcleodganj/be