"Bar and lounge under a timber roof at WelcomHeritage Natraj, McLeod Ganj","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":9},{"url":"https://www.welcomheritagehotels.in/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwhcms.cinuniverse.com%2Fimages%2Fwhimages%2F5a79bf23f8654d82b577168ad125f8be20251217132047093.jpg&w=1920&q=75","alt":"Open terrace dining with valley views at WelcomHeritage Natraj, McLeod Ganj","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":10}]'::jsonb, '[{"name":"Standard Room","description":"Cosy room with a queen-size bed.","bed_type":"Queen","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Luxury Room","description":"230 sq ft (21 sq m) room.","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Premium Room","description":"Room with an expansive private balcony and valley views.","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Luxury Suite","description":"Suite with a separate living area and private balcony.","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Premium Suite","description":"Largest category at 426 sq ft (40 sq m).","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true}]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is WelcomHeritage Natraj located?","answer":"WelcomHeritage Natraj is in Ward 3, McLeod Ganj (near the Dalai Lama''s residence). Nearby: Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- about 5 min walk; McLeod Ganj main square -- about 10 min walk."},{"question":"What are the check-in and check-out times at WelcomHeritage Natraj?","answer":"Check-in is from 14:00 and check-out is by 12:00. Confirm early check-in or late check-out when you enquire."},{"question":"Who is WelcomHeritage Natraj best for?","answer":"It suits couples, fam