('norling-house-norbulingka-sidhbari', 'Norling House (Norbulingka Institute)', 'guesthouse', 'published', 'directory', 'Norling House is the guesthouse of the Norbulingka Institute, the centre for Tibetan arts and crafts in Sidhpur, below Dharamshala. It sits within the institute''s gardens, among water channels, small bridges and shady trees, and staying here means you can wander the grounds early in the morning or after the day visitors have left. Each room is themed around a different animal from Tibetan mythology, and the furniture and paintings were made in Norbulingka''s own workshops.

It is a calm, unusual base for travellers interested in Tibetan culture, art and Buddhism, and for anyone who would rather be in green, quiet surroundings than in the bustle of McLeod Ganj. The institute''s workshops, temple, museum and cafe are on the doorstep, and the Gyuto Monastery is a short drive away. You will need a taxi to reach McLeod Ganj and the main Dharamshala market.', 'A guesthouse inside the Norbulingka Institute gardens, with rooms decorated and furnished by the institute''s own Tibetan artists.', 'dharamshala', 'Norbulingka Institute, Sidhpur / Sidhbari', 'Norbulingka Institute, Sidhpur / Sidhbari', 'Dharamshala', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["Restaurant","Cafe","Parking","Gardens","WiFi","Breakfast included","Free parking","Air conditioning","24-hour front desk","Housekeeping","Hair dryer"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://images.trvl-media.com/lodging/105000000/104890000/104887700/104887654/c5e79e54.jpg","alt":"Stone pathway to Norling House in the Norbulingka gardens, Sidhpur","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://images.trvl-media.com/lodging/105000000/104890000/104887700/104887654/c5f06f23.jpg","alt":"Painted Tibetan-style entrance of Norling House, Norbulingka Institute","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://images.trvl-media.com/lodging/105000000/104890000/104887700/104887654/66122233.jpg","alt":"Stone building with balcony and outdoor seating at Norling House, Norbulingka","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://images.trvl-media.com/lodging/105000000/104890000/104887700/104887654/7daa1b04.jpg","alt":"Guest room with hand-painted Tibetan furniture at Norling House, Norbulingka","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://images.trvl-media.com/lodging/105000000/104890000/104887700/104887654/230f536d.jpg","alt":"Guest room with Tibetan painting and wooden furniture at Norling House, Norbulingka","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4},{"url":"https://images.trvl-media.com/lodging/105000000/104890000/104887700/104887654/8c1576b2.jpg","alt":"Snow-leopard themed guest room at Norling House, Norbulingka","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":5},{"url":"https://images.trvl-media.com/lodging/105000000/104890000/104887700/104887654/6f1e3eed.jpg","alt":"Single-bed room with painted wardrobe at Norling House, Norbulingka","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":6},{"url":"https://images.trvl-media.com/lodging/105000000/104890000/104887700/104887654/3c07cac1.jpg","alt":"Suite living room with Tibetan furniture at Norling House, Norbulingka","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":7},{"url":"https://images.trvl-media.com/lodging/105000000/104890000/104887700/104887654/57a3a054.jpg","alt":"Sitting room with bookshelves at Norling House, Norbulingka","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":8},{"url":"https://images.trvl-media.com/lodging/105000000/104890000/104887700/104887654/24373e14.jpg","alt":"Private patio with seating outside a room at Norling House, Norbulingka","category":"amenity","is_primary":false,"sort_order":9},{"url":"https://images.trvl-media.com/lodging/105000000/104890000/104887700/104887654/65ba08d1.jpg","alt":"Skylit lobby at Norling House, Norbulingka Institute","category":"lobby","is_primary":false,"sort_order":10},{"url":"https://images.trvl-media.com/lodging/105000000/104890000/104887700/104887654/bba95217.jpg","alt":"Norling House seen from the gardens of the Norbulingka Institute","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":11}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is Norling House (Norbulingka Institute) located?","answer":"Norling House (Norbulingka Institute) is in Norbulingka Institute, Sidhpur / Sidhbari. Nearby: Norbulingka workshops and temple -- on site; Gyuto Monastery (Sidhbari) -- about 10 min drive."},{"question":"What are the check-in and check-out times at Norling House (Norbulingka Institute)?","answer":"Check-in is from 12:00 and check-out is by 11:30. Confirm early check-in or late check-out when you enquire."},{"question":"Who is Norling House (Norbulingka Institute) best for?","answer":"It suits culture seekers, couples, slow travellers. See other stays in Dharamshala if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for Norling House (Norbulingka Institute)?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in Dharamshala."}]'::jsonb, '12:00', '11:30', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'mid-range', '["Set inside the Norbulingka Institute gardens","Rooms themed on Tibetan mythology","Hand-made furniture and artwork from the institute workshops","Peaceful setting away from town traffic"]'::jsonb, '["Culture seekers","Couples","Slow travellers"]'::jsonb, '["Norbulingka workshops and temple -- on site","Gyuto Monastery (Sidhbari) -- about 10 min drive","Kotwali Bazaar, Dharamshala -- about 20 min drive","McLeod Ganj -- about 40 min drive"]'::jsonb, 'https://india.norbulingka.org/pages/norbulingka-accommodation', 'https://www.expedia.com/Dharamshala-Hotels-Norling-House.h104887654.Hotel-Information', 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://india.norbulingka.org/pages/norbulingka-accommodation , https://www.travelocity.com/Dharamshala-Hotels-Norling-House.h104887654.Hotel-Reviews', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('radisson-blu-resort-dharamshala-kandi', 'Radisson Blu Resort Dharamshala', 'resort', 'published', 'directory', 'Radisson Blu Resort Dharamshala stands in Kandi village on the Khaniyara side of town, roughly four kilometres from Kotwali Bazaar and close to the HPCA cricket stadium. The setting is at the foot of the Dhauladhar range, and many rooms have balconies looking up at the mountains.

This is one of the most complete resorts in the area. There is an outdoor pool plus a children''s pool, a full-service spa with sauna, a gym, several places to eat and drink including a bar, and play areas for children. That makes it a natural pick for families, wedding parties and anyone combining a cricket match with a holiday. The trade-off is distance: McLeod Ganj and the Tibetan sights are a drive away, so plan on taxis for sightseeing. The airport at Gaggal is around half an hour away by road.', 'A full-service resort a few kilometres from lower Dharamshala, with an outdoor pool, spa and Dhauladhar views from balcony rooms.', 'dharamshala', 'Village Kandi, Khaniyara Road', 'Village Kandi, Khaniyara Road', 'Dharamshala', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Restaurant","Bar","Swimming pool","Spa","Gym","Kids'' play area","Parking","Mountain views","Luggage storage","Mountain view"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://media.radissonhotels.net/image/radisson-blu-resort-dharamshala/view-from-property/16256-124822-f74910617_XL.jpg","alt":"Aerial view of Radisson Blu Resort Dharamshala with its pool and the Dhauladhar range","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://media.radissonhotels.net/image/radisson-blu-resort-dharamshala/exterior/16256-124822-f86622208_XL.jpg","alt":"Resort buildings and driveway at Radisson Blu Resort Dharamshala","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://media.radissonhotels.net/image/radisson-blu-resort-dharamshala/guest-room/16256-124822-f88034525_XL.jpg","alt":"King guest room at Radisson Blu Resort Dharamshala","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://media.radissonhotels.net/image/radisson-blu-resort-dharamshala/guest-room/16256-124822-f88906023_XL.jpg","alt":"Guest room with king bed at Radisson Blu Resort Dharamshala","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://media.radissonhotels.net/image/radisson-blu-resort-dharamshala/guest-room/16256-124822-f88034527_XL.jpg","alt":"Guest room with king bed and wardrobe at Radisson Blu Resort Dharamshala","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4},{"url":"https://media.radissonhotels.net/image/radisson-blu-resort-dharamshala/suite/16256-124822-f74910551_XL.jpg","alt":"Suite bedroom with balcony at Radisson Blu Resort Dharamshala","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":5},{"url":"https://media.radissonhotels.net/image/radisson-blu-resort-dharamshala/suite/16256-124822-f88034573_XL.jpg","alt":"Suite bedroom with sofa at Radisson Blu Resort Dharamshala","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":6},{"url":"https://media.radissonhotels.net/image/radisson-blu-resort-dharamshala/suite/16256-124822-f74910553_XL.jpg","alt":"Suite living room with balcony at Radisson Blu Resort Dharamshala","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":7},{"url":"https://media.radissonhotels.net/image/radisson-blu-resort-dharamshala/guest-room-bath/16256-124822-f88906033_XL.jpg","alt":"Guest bathroom with walk-in shower at Radisson Blu Resort Dharamshala","category":"bathroom","is_primary":false,"sort_order":8},{"url":"https://media.radissonhotels.net/image/radisson-blu-resort-dharamshala/restaurant/16256-124822-f81347665_XL.jpg","alt":"All-day restaurant at Radisson Blu Resort Dharamshala","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":9},{"url":"https://media.radissonhotels.net/image/radisson-blu-resort-dharamshala/spa/16256-124822-f74910517_XL.jpg","alt":"Spa treatment room at Radisson Blu Resort Dharamshala","category":"amenity","is_primary":false,"sort_order":10}]'::jsonb, '[{"name":"Standard Room","description":"32 sq m room; sleeps 2 adults plus 2 children.","bed_type":"King","max_occupancy":2,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Standard Room - Valley View","description":"32 sq m room with valley view; sleeps 2 adults plus 2 children.","bed_type":"King","max_occupancy":2,"base_price":0,"rat