('atman-dharamshala-kandi', 'Atman, Dharamshala', 'resort', 'published', 'directory', 'Atman is a small boutique resort run by the Leisure Hotels group in Kandi village, on the Khanyara Road below the Dhauladhar. It opened in 2021 and was built in the traditional Himachali kath-kuni style of layered stone and timber, using local materials. There are fewer than twenty rooms, spread across deluxe, valley-view, junior suite and family suite categories, and the rooms have large windows and balconies looking towards the mountains or out over the Kangra valley.

Food is served at an all-day restaurant and at Fuzion, a garden cafe and lounge. The resort has a yoga and meditation area, a library and outdoor lawns, which suit couples and families looking for a quiet, design-led stay rather than a big-resort scene. Like the other properties in Kandi, it is a drive from both McLeod Ganj and the airport, so a car or taxi is useful.', 'A boutique resort from Leisure Hotels built in local stone-and-timber style, with Kangra valley views, a garden cafe and yoga space.', 'dharamshala', 'Village Kandi, Khanyara Road', 'Village Kandi, Khanyara Road', 'Dharamshala', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["Restaurant","Cafe and lounge","Yoga space","Library","Gardens","Mountain views","Swimming pool","Bar","24-hour front desk","24-hour in-room dining","Daily housekeeping","Recreation room","Mountain view","Balcony"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://assets.simplotel.com/simplotel/image/upload/q_80,w_1600,c_limit/atman-dharamshala/DSC00792_poke3c.jpg","alt":"Stone-and-timber building and lawns at Atman, Dharamshala","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://assets.simplotel.com/simplotel/image/upload/q_80,w_1600,c_limit/atman-dharamshala/DSC00844_gzjgyi.jpg","alt":"Atman, Dharamshala lit up at night","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://assets.simplotel.com/simplotel/image/upload/q_80,w_1600,c_limit/atman-dharamshala/DSC00780_ydhtsb.jpg","alt":"Swimming pool with mountain backdrop at Atman, Dharamshala","category":"pool","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://assets.simplotel.com/simplotel/image/upload/q_80,w_1600,c_limit/atman-dharamshala/DELUXE_ROOM_nbtfha.jpg","alt":"Deluxe Room with carved headboard at Atman, Dharamshala","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://assets.simplotel.com/simplotel/image/upload/q_80,w_1600,c_limit/atman-dharamshala/Copy_of_TGP07646-HDR-1_uk0wpq.jpg","alt":"Room with balcony and valley view at Atman, Dharamshala","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4},{"url":"https://assets.simplotel.com/simplotel/image/upload/q_80,w_1600,c_limit/atman-dharamshala/TGP07439-HDR-1_copy_t2wwaf.jpg","alt":"Suite with swing seat and valley-view windows at Atman, Dharamshala","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":5},{"url":"https://assets.simplotel.com/simplotel/image/upload/q_80,w_1600,c_limit/atman-dharamshala/TGP07657_y4w6jl.jpg","alt":"Room with carved headboard and balcony at Atman, Dharamshala","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":6},{"url":"https://assets.simplotel.com/simplotel/image/upload/q_80,w_1600,c_limit/atman-dharamshala/FUZION_CAFE1_ozc2oy.jpg","alt":"Fuzion Lounge and Deck terrace at sunset, Atman, Dharamshala","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":7},{"url":"https://assets.simplotel.com/simplotel/image/upload/q_80,w_1600,c_limit/atman-dharamshala/FUZION_LOUNGE_2_jepphp.jpg","alt":"Fuzion lounge seating at Atman, Dharamshala","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":8},{"url":"https://assets.simplotel.com/simplotel/image/upload/q_80,w_1600,c_limit/atman-dharamshala/DSC00760_sgnqwn.jpg","alt":"Lounge with Tibetan-style furniture at Atman, Dharamshala","category":"lobby","is_primary":false,"sort_order":9},{"url":"https://assets.simplotel.com/simplotel/image/upload/q_80,w_1600,c_limit/atman-dharamshala/DSC00810_tb57vq.jpg","alt":"Garden dining set-up at Atman, Dharamshala","category":"amenity","is_primary":false,"sort_order":10},{"url":"https://assets.simplotel.com/simplotel/image/upload/q_80,w_1600,c_limit/atman-dharamshala/DSC00693_dcj7iq.jpg","alt":"Buddha statue in the garden at Atman, Dharamshala","category":"amenity","is_primary":false,"sort_order":11}]'::jsonb, '[{"name":"Deluxe Room","description":"Base category; 4 rooms with views of the valley.","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Superior Room","description":"Upgraded category; 7 rooms in total.","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Suite","description":"350 sq ft suite.","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Premium Suite","description":"375 sq ft suite with walk-in closet and a balcony facing the Dhauladhar range.","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true}]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is Atman, Dharamshala located?","answer":"Atman, Dharamshala is in Village Kandi, Khanyara Road. Nearby: Kotwali Bazaar, Dharamshala -- about 15 min drive; HPCA Cricket Stadium -- about 15 min drive."},{"question":"What are the check-in and check-out times at Atman, Dharamshala?","answer":"Check-in is from 13:00 and check-out is by 11:00. Confirm early check-in or late check-out when you enquire."},{"question":"Who is Atman, Dharamshala best for?","answer":"It suits couples, families, wellness travellers. See other stays in Dharamshala if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for Atman, Dharamshala?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in Dharamshala."}]'::jsonb, '13:00', '11:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'upscale', '["Built in traditional kath-kuni stone-and-timber style","Small, boutique scale with valley and mountain views","Garden cafe and lounge, plus an all-day restaurant","Yoga and meditation space"]'::jsonb, '["Couples","Families","Wellness travellers"]'::jsonb, '["Kotwali Bazaar, Dharamshala -- about 15 min drive","HPCA Cricket Stadium -- about 15 min drive","McLeod Ganj -- about 35 min drive","Kangra (Gaggal) Airport -- about 35 min drive"]'::jsonb, 'https://www.leisurehotels.co.in/destinations/dharamshala.html', 'https://www.leisurehotels.co.in/dharamshala/atman/', 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://www.leisurehotels.co.in/dharamshala/atman/faqs.html , https://traveltradejournal.com/leisure-hotels-group-unveils-atman-a-boutique-resort-in-dharamshala/', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('hptdc-hotel-kunal-dharamshala', 'HPTDC Hotel Kunal', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'Hotel Kunal is one of the Himachal Pradesh Tourism Development Corporation''s properties in lower Dharamshala, and its main selling point is convenience. It stands close to the Dharamshala bus station, which makes it a practical stop if you are arriving late on an overnight Volvo from Delhi or leaving early the next morning, and it is a short ride from the HPCA stadium and the Kotwali Bazaar market.

The rooms, in deluxe and semi-deluxe categories, are simple and airy, with attached bathrooms and hot water. There is a restaurant, room service, WiFi and parking within the premises. It will not win prizes for character, but for travellers who want a government-run hotel with predictable standards in the lower town, rather than a climb up to McLeod Ganj, it does the job well. Bookings can be made through the HPTDC website.', 'A no-fuss Himachal Tourism hotel close to the Dharamshala bus stand, handy for late arrivals, early departures and cricket days.', 'dharamshala', 'Near the Dharamshala bus stand, lower Dharamshala', 'Near the Dharamshala bus stand, lower Dharamshala', 'Dharamshala', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Restaurant","Room service","Parking","Hot water"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://hptdc.hp.gov.in/public/uploads/hotel_images/1765778733_693fa52da4be0_hotel.jpg","alt":"Building and forecourt of HPTDC Hotel Kunal, Dharamshala","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://hptdc.hp.gov.in/public/uploads/hotel_images/1765778733_693fa52da5a89_Deluxe.jpg","alt":"Deluxe room at HPTDC Hotel Kunal, Dharamshala","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://hptdc.hp.gov.in/public/uploads/hotel_images/1765778733_693fa52da6504_Semi%20Deluxe.jpg","alt":"Semi-deluxe room at HPTDC Hotel Kunal, Dharamshala","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2}]'::jsonb, '[{"name":"Deluxe Room","description":"Airy, well-furnished room with attached bathroom.","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Semi-Deluxe Room","description":"Room with attached bathroom and hot and cold running water.","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true}]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is HPTDC Hotel Kunal located?","answer":"HPTDC Hotel Kunal is in Near the Dharamshala bus stand, lower Dharamshala. Nearby: Dharamshala bus stand -- a few minutes on foot; Kotwali Bazaar -- about 5 min drive."},{"question":"Who is HPTDC Hotel Kunal best for?","answer":"It suits transit stays, families, cricket fans. See other stays in Dharamshala if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for HPTDC Hotel Kunal?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in Dharamshala."}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'budget', '["Run by Himachal Tourism (HPTDC)","Close to the Dharamshala bus station","Parking within the premises","Restaurant and room service"]'::jsonb, '["Transit stays","Families","Cricket fans"]'::jsonb, '["Dharamshala bus stand -- a few minutes on foot","Kotwali Bazaar -- about 5 min drive","HPCA Cricket Stadium -- about 10 min drive","McLeod Ganj -- about 25 min drive"]'::jsonb, 'https://hptdc.hp.gov.in/hotel-detail/55', 'https://hptdc.hp.gov.in/hotel-detail/55', 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://hptdc.hp.gov.in/hotel-detail/55', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('the-hosteller-dharamshala-bangatu', 'The Hosteller Dharamshala', 'hostel', 'published', 'directory', 'This outpost of The Hosteller chain sits in Bangatu village on the outskirts of Dharamshala, well away from the McLeod Ganj crowds. It offers mixed and female-only dorms with en-suite bathrooms, lockers and privacy curtains, as well as private rooms with a seating area and kettle. The rooftop vegetarian cafe has sweeping views over the valley, and the common areas host board games, foosball and, weather permitting, bonfire evenings.

It suits backpackers and remote workers who want a calm base with a social space and workstations, and who do not mind being out of town. Be aware of the access: the last stretch, around four kilometres, is an unpaved road that needs careful driving, and there is no parking on site, so arriving by taxi is easiest. The Dharamshala bus stand is roughly 7 km away, about half an hour by cab.', 'A rural hostel outside Dharamshala with dorms, private rooms, a rooftop vegetarian cafe and wide valley views, for travellers who want quiet.', 'dharamshala', 'Bangatu village, outskirts of Dharamshala', 'Bangatu village, outskirts of Dharamshala', 'Dharamshala', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Cafe","Lockers","Workstations","Common room","Mountain views","Cafe (vegetarian)","Bonfire","Common area","Indoor games","Housekeeping","CCTV","Front desk","Water dispenser","Pet friendly (private rooms)","Mountain view"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://static.thehosteller.com/Hostel/the-hosteller-dharamshala/image-1750922045782.jpg","alt":"The Hosteller Dharamshala building on a hilltop in Bangatu village with valley and Dhauladhar views","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://static.thehosteller.com/Hostel/the-hosteller-dharamshala/image-1750922660284.jpg","alt":"Colourful The Hosteller Dharamshala building set among terraced fields and mountains","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://static.thehosteller.com/Hostel/the-hosteller-dharamshala/image-1760110143815.jpg","alt":"Rooftop cafe terrace at The Hosteller Dharamshala lit up at dusk over the valley","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://static.thehosteller.com/Hostel/the-hosteller-dharamshala/image-1750922664749.jpg","alt":"Rooftop of The Hosteller Dharamshala at dusk with the hillside lights behind","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://static.thehosteller.com/Hostel/the-hosteller-dharamshala/image-1750924022247.jpg","alt":"Private double room with sofa and balcony at The Hosteller Dharamshala","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4},{"url":"https://static.thehosteller.com/Hostel/the-hosteller-dharamshala/image-1751520071264.jpg","alt":"Private room with king bed and balcony door at The Hosteller Dharamshala","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":5},{"url":"https://static.thehosteller.com/Hostel/the-hosteller-dharamshala/image-1750923891253.jpg","alt":"Dorm with bunk beds and big windows at The Hosteller Dharamshala","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":6},{"url":"https://static.thehosteller.com/Hostel/the-hosteller-dharamshala/image-1750923895938.jpg","alt":"Bunk-bed dorm with privacy curtains at The Hosteller Dharamshala","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":7},{"url":"https://static.thehosteller.com/Hostel/the-hosteller-dharamshala/image-1751520127139.jpg","alt":"Cafe seating with board games at The Hosteller Dharamshala","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":8},{"url":"https://static.thehosteller.com/Hostel/the-hosteller-dharamshala/image-1750923961633.jpg","alt":"Common area with bookshelves and work tables at The Hosteller Dharamshala","category":"lobby","is_primary":false,"sort_order":9},{"url":"https://static.thehosteller.com/Hostel/the-hosteller-dharamshala/image-1750923965802.jpg","alt":"Common area with foosball table at The Hosteller Dharamshala","category":"amenity","is_primary":false,"sort_order":10},{"url":"https://static.thehosteller.com/Hostel/the-hosteller-dharamshala/image-1750923944599.jpg","alt":"Open-air rooftop seating overlooking the valley at The Hosteller Dharamshala","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":11}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is The Hosteller Dharamshala located?","answer":"The Hosteller Dharamshala is in Bangatu village, outskirts of Dharamshala. Nearby: Dharamshala bus stand (ISBT) -- about 7 km, 25-30 min by cab; Kangra (Gaggal) Airport -- about 17 km."},{"question":"What are the check-in and check-out times at The Hosteller Dharamshala?","answer":"Check-in is from 14:00 and check-out is by 11:00. Confirm early check-in or late check-out when you enquire."},{"question":"Who is The Hosteller Dharamshala best for?","answer":"It suits backpackers, remote workers, solo travellers. See other stays in Dharamshala if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for The Hosteller Dharamshala?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in Dharamshala."}]'::jsonb, '14:00', '11:00', 'Pets are allowed for private room guests only, not in dorms; owners are responsible for any damage.', 'Smoking is permitted only in designated smoking areas; alcohol and drugs are prohibited.', NULL, 'budget', '["Mixed and female-only dorms with en-suite bathrooms","Rooftop vegetarian cafe with valley views","Workstations and 24-hour common areas","Quiet rural setting"]'::jsonb, '["Backpackers","Remote workers","Solo travellers"]'::jsonb, '["Dharamshala bus stand (ISBT) -- about 7 km, 25-30 min by cab","Kangra (Gaggal) Airport -- about 17 km","McLeod Ganj -- about 45 min drive"]'::jsonb, 'https://www.thehosteller.com/hostels/the-hosteller-dharamshala', 'https://www.thehosteller.com/hostels/the-hosteller-dharamshala', 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://www.thehosteller.com/hostels/the-hosteller-dharamshala , https://www.expedia.com/es/Dharamshala-Hoteles-The-Hosteller-Dharamshala.h122883332.Informacion-Hotel', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('udechee-huts-naddi', 'Hotel Udechee Huts', 'homestay', 'published', 'directory', 'Udechee Huts is a hillside property of around fourteen rooms and cottages in Naddi, roughly 5 km above McLeod Ganj. It sits among pine, oak and deodar on a small rise that looks straight at the Dhauladhar, and the room categories range from single-room cottages to upper-floor rooms with private balconies or terraces. Each has a sitting area or balcony for taking in the view.

Guests regularly single out the staff and the kitchen, which turns out Indian, Chinese and continental dishes with a home-cooked feel. It is a good base for couples and families who want quiet mountain mornings rather than town nightlife, and for walkers heading towards Dal Lake, Naddi viewpoint or the Kareri side. The property is built on a slope with no lift, so expect some stairs, and note that geysers take a little while to heat up.', 'A small cottage-style hotel on a pine-covered hillock in Naddi, facing the Dhauladhar snowline, known for warm staff and home-style food.', 'naddi', 'Naddi village, above McLeod Ganj', 'Naddi village, above McLeod Ganj', 'Naddi', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Restaurant","Parking","Travel desk","Kids'' play area","Mountain views","Room service","Hot and cold air conditioning","Tea/coffee station","Hair dryer","Satellite TV","Doctor on call","Lounge and library","Indoor games","Mountain view"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://udecheehuts.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/1714482089556.jpg","alt":"Stone-and-slate main building with ivy-covered front at Udechee Huts, Naddi","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://udecheehuts.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/1714482089545.jpg","alt":"Udechee Huts restaurant building and stone terrace facing the Dhauladhar, Naddi","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://udecheehuts.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/1714498348606.jpg","alt":"Cottages and garden lit up at night at Udechee Huts, Naddi","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://udecheehuts.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Udechee.jpg","alt":"Dhauladhar range seen from the terrace at Udechee Huts, Naddi","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://udecheehuts.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/295A2523.jpg","alt":"Deluxe Single Room Cottage interior at Udechee Huts, Naddi","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4},{"url":"https://udecheehuts.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/1714629950366.jpg","alt":"Deluxe Independent room with private terrace at Udechee Huts, Naddi","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":5},{"url":"https://udecheehuts.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/295A2740.jpg","alt":"Deluxe High Floor room with private balcony at Udechee Huts, Naddi","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":6},{"url":"https://udecheehuts.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/295A2691.jpg","alt":"Super Deluxe room with private balcony at Udechee Huts, Naddi","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":7},{"url":"https://udecheehuts.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/295A2596.jpg","alt":"Super Deluxe Single Room Cottage at Udechee Huts, Naddi","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":8},{"url":"https://udecheehuts.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/1714629950532.jpg","alt":"Executive Single Room Cottage with sitting area and mountain-facing windows at Udechee Huts, Naddi","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":9},{"url":"https://udecheehuts.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/1714498348500.jpg","alt":"Dining hall and lounge with bay windows at Udechee Huts, Naddi","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":10}]'::jsonb, '[{"name":"Deluxe Single Room Cottage","description":"Entry-level cottage near the restaurant with a small mountain-facing sit-out; sleeps up to 3 adults with a chargeable extra bed.","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":3,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Deluxe Independent Room with Private Terrace","description":"Lower-ground-floor room (about 250 sq ft) with a mountain-facing sit-out, reached by 15-20 steps; extra bed available.","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":3,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Deluxe High Floor Room with Private Balcony","description":"One of two adjoining first-floor rooms (about 275 sq ft) above the restaurant with unobstructed Dhauladhar