('dragon-i-resorts-naddi', 'Dragon I Resorts', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'Dragon I Resorts is a compact hotel of about a dozen rooms close to the Naddi viewpoint, at roughly 1,800 metres. Its pitch is simple: little stands between the rooms and the Dhauladhar, so the morning view of the range is the highlight of any stay. Rooms are heated, which is welcome on Naddi''s cold winter nights, and include family rooms that sleep four.

Guests often mention the friendly staff and the home-style food, including local Himachali dishes, served at the in-house restaurant. It suits couples and families who want a quiet hilltop stay with easy access to sunset walks at the viewpoint and Dal Lake, while staying within a short drive of McLeod Ganj. Parking is available, but as with most of Naddi, the lanes are narrow, so arriving by local taxi can be easier than driving yourself.', 'A small, well-liked hotel steps from the Naddi viewpoint, with an unobstructed outlook over the Dhauladhar and home-style Himachali cooking.', 'naddi', 'Near Naddi Viewpoint, Naddi', 'Near Naddi Viewpoint, Naddi', 'Naddi', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Restaurant","Parking","Heating","Mountain views","Free parking","Shuttle service","Tour desk","24-hour front desk","Shared kitchen","Ironing service","Daily housekeeping","Fireplace","Mountain view"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0223o120009zg5dsf91C7.jpg","alt":"Dragon I Resorts building with Dragon I Naddi signboard and balconies","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0585r12000ogfpwgmA0B5.jpg","alt":"Dragon I Resorts, Naddi, covered in winter snow","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0225z120009zg4hfs4BC7.jpg","alt":"Snow-covered cottages and steps at Dragon I Resorts, Naddi","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0226n12000qf84jrfDAA1.jpg","alt":"Double room with wooden floor and writing desk at Dragon I Resorts, Naddi","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0585412000sv4odmsEAD3.jpg","alt":"Attic-style room with double bed at Dragon I Resorts, Naddi","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0583g12000tbw3hi56474.jpg","alt":"Dining hall with glass walls facing the mountains at Dragon I Resorts, Naddi","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":5},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0582212000t259bg0AC0A.jpg","alt":"Dining table with snow-capped Dhauladhar view at Dragon I Resorts, Naddi","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":6},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0582b12000svrd4kg351E.jpg","alt":"Wood-panelled reception desk at Dragon I Resorts, Naddi","category":"lobby","is_primary":false,"sort_order":7}]'::jsonb, '[{"name":"Family Room","description":"Non-smoking family room with one double and two single beds.","bed_type":"1 Double + 2 Single","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Double Room","description":"Double room with stair-free main entrance.","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Super Deluxe Room","description":"Non-smoking room with one double bed.","bed_type":"Double","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true}]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is Dragon I Resorts located?","answer":"Dragon I Resorts is in Near Naddi Viewpoint, Naddi. Nearby: Naddi Viewpoint -- about 3 min walk; Dal Lake -- about 3 km."},{"question":"What are the check-in and check-out times at Dragon I Resorts?","answer":"Check-in is from 14:00 and check-out is by 12:00. Confirm early check-in or late check-out when you enquire."},{"question":"Who is Dragon I Resorts best for?","answer":"It suits couples, families, sunset seekers. See other stays in Naddi if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for Dragon I Resorts?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in Naddi."}]'::jsonb, '14:00', '12:00', NULL, 'Smoking is permitted only in designated areas.', NULL, 'mid-range', '["Steps from the N