('aliza-inn-and-suites-naddi', 'Aliza Inn and Suites', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'Aliza Inn and Suites sits in Naddi village, above Dal Lake and only a few minutes on foot from the Naddi viewpoint. The hotel was remodelled in 2024 and offers several room types, from standard rooms to premium rooms facing the mountains, executive rooms facing the valley, and family rooms for larger groups.

Guests frequently comment on how clean the rooms are and on the quality of the food, and the hotel has a terrace, a cafe and a firepit for cold evenings. It suits families and couples who want the calm of Naddi, with sunset at the viewpoint and an easy walk down to Dal Lake, while staying close enough to McLeod Ganj for day trips to the temple and markets. Fast WiFi also makes it workable for a few days of remote work with a view.', 'A recently refreshed hotel in Naddi village above Dal Lake, a short walk from the viewpoint, with mountain and valley-view rooms.', 'naddi', 'Naddi village, above Dal Lake', 'Naddi village, above Dal Lake', 'Naddi', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Cafe","Terrace","Firepit","Mountain views","Free parking","Restaurant","Room service","Spa","Lift","24-hour front desk","Garden","Banquet hall","Meeting room","Children''s play area","Laundry service","Luggage storage","Mountain view"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://images.trvl-media.com/lodging/77000000/76420000/76415000/76414977/e9b6c78c.jpg?impolicy=resizecrop&rw=1200&ra=fit","alt":"Aliza Inn and Suites building on the Naddi hillside at sunset","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://images.trvl-media.com/lodging/77000000/76420000/76415000/76414977/ec3e8628.jpg?impolicy=resizecrop&rw=1200&ra=fit","alt":"Aerial view of Aliza Inn and Suites among the houses of Naddi village","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://images.trvl-media.com/lodging/77000000/76420000/76415000/76414977/a0392911.jpg?impolicy=resizecrop&rw=1200&ra=fit","alt":"Aliza Inn and Suites lit up at night above the valley, Naddi","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://images.trvl-media.com/lodging/77000000/76420000/76415000/76414977/7625cd18.jpg?impolicy=resizecrop&rw=1200&ra=fit","alt":"Mountain-view room with king bed and large windows at Aliza Inn and Suites, Naddi","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https:/