('tranquil-trails-homestay-naddi', 'Tranquil Trails Home Stay', 'homestay', 'published', 'directory', 'Tranquil Trails is a small homestay in Naddi with just a handful of rooms, from doubles and a family room to a larger apartment with a mountain view. It was recently renovated, and the units have private bathrooms, a terrace or balcony and kitchenette facilities, which is useful for longer stays. Outside there is a garden and a sun terrace for soaking up the views.

Guests consistently praise the host for being friendly and helpful and rate the breakfasts highly, with local dishes and fresh fruit on offer. Yoga sessions can be arranged, and packed lunches are available for days out on the trails. It suits couples, small families and slow travellers who want a quiet village base with a personal touch, and walkers using Naddi as a jumping-off point for Dal Lake and the surrounding forest paths. McLeod Ganj is a short taxi ride away.', 'A small, recently renovated family-run homestay in Naddi with terrace rooms, kitchenettes and mountain views, praised for its host and breakfasts.', 'naddi', 'Naddi village', 'Naddi village', 'Naddi', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Breakfast available","Kitchenette","Garden","Terrace","Mountain views","Free parking","Sun terrace","Shared kitchen","Heating","Outdoor fireplace","Room service","Packed lunches","Yoga classes","Tour desk","Luggage storage","Mountain view"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/818334178.jpg?k=d22ec9ffc02b39e4d4f84474a30ad212638c3c1c0fe8c15a8fb63628bcabd141&o=","alt":"Three-storey Tranquil Trails Home Stay building with garden, Naddi","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1280x900/818335217.jpg?k=3938bcf3b9410b8d031f7d5842c7b0dd441b9fc4d3baa8d4ba25f36544928588&o=","alt":"Side view of Tranquil Trails Home Stay with balconies, Naddi","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/828802131.jpg?k=5a042c8e8a021f7f7947a4c54fa195819e1674e61be9e525a3392c442785b086&o=","alt":"Double room with garden-facing window at Tranquil Trails Home Stay, Naddi","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1280x900/759304004.jpg?k=497def1304a99dfd1b8da56d932f09e2da3d4308cac106d51080fdf9805bd81c&o=","alt":"Double room with kitchenette counter at Tranquil Trails Home Stay, Naddi","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1280x900/667594890.jpg?k=bf08fe828e832e5426b38248c747e5ce7738b28c3df1a6571f63af5924ae5624&o=","alt":"Bright double room with marble floor at Tranquil Trails Home Stay, Naddi","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4},{"url":"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1280x900/773239365.jpg?k=7a8d9dfa6161035816d24e6b792a8bf86577f0e32ea84f7e0d7cf68a87436645&o=","alt":"Private bathroom with shower at Tranquil Trails Home Stay, Naddi","category":"bathroom","is_primary":false,"sort_order":5},{"url":"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1280x900/677400767.jpg?k=4e3b5ebd4c5e57e06ab391439c68258bfcdd0de791c3ea4411ed3177f4a1a0a2&o=","alt":"Balcony sit-out looking over Naddi village at Tranquil Trails Home Stay","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":6},{"url":"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1280x900/818833552.jpg?k=496905223b55ee46aff8d95364130ab4f0ccb9f31b1e0bdda5f1e7d61d7c7fd3&o=","alt":"Snow-capped Dhauladhar view from Tranquil Trails Home Stay, Naddi","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":7}]'::jsonb, '[{"name":"Double Room with Private Bathroom","description":"14 sq m double with private bathroom, terrace, kitchen and private entrance.","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Double Room","description":"13 sq m double with private bathroom, terrace, kitchen and private entrance.","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Double Room with Balcony","description":"14 sq m double with private bathroom, kitchen and private entrance.","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Family Room with Private Bathroom","description":"17 sq m family room with private bathro