('loopin-mcleodganj-upper-bhagsu', 'Loopin McLeodganj', 'hostel', 'published', 'directory', 'Loopin is a newer backpacker hostel in Upper Bhagsunag that has built a strong reputation with guests for cleanliness and friendly hosts. Its hillside position gives open views over the valley, and the overall feel is more laid-back than party-focused, making it a good fit for travellers who want a social space without late-night noise.

One practical advantage is the community kitchen, which lets longer-stay guests cook their own meals rather than eating out for every meal. There is also tea and coffee making, filtered drinking water, a pool table and luggage storage for those heading off on overnight treks. Check-in runs from afternoon into the evening, so late arrivals should message ahead. From here it is a short walk down to the Bhagsunag temple and the waterfall trail, and the hillside path towards Dharamkot starts nearby.', 'Well-reviewed Upper Bhagsunag hostel with valley views, a shared guest kitchen and a relaxed common area with a pool table.', 'bhagsu', 'Upper Bhagsunag', 'Upper Bhagsunag', 'Bhagsu', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["Free Wi-Fi","Shared kitchen","Tea and coffee making","Filtered water","Pool table","Luggage storage","WiFi","Common room","Games room","Garden","Lockers","Laundry facilities","Hot showers","Linen included"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/q_auto,w_1200/propertyimages/3/338950/suhxi5iqcywpt95y67be.jpg","alt":"Purple three-storey Loopin McLeodganj hostel building with balconies, Upper Bhagsunag","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/q_auto,w_1200/propertyimages/3/338950/dx401p7dufwbvqjjttb5.jpg","alt":"Balcony with seating and valley view at Loopin McLeodganj, Upper Bhagsunag","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/q_auto,w_1200/propertyimages/3/338950/as2zbnwrijco6jz21z9h.jpg","alt":"Dorm with bunk beds, curtains and lockers at Loopin McLeodganj","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/q_auto,w_1200/propertyimages/3/338950/rxwcz3e9brzr2qpsuvl7.jpg","alt":"Bunk-bed dorm room at Loopin McLeodganj, Upper Bhagsunag","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/q_auto,w_1200/propertyimages/3/338950/neqetrutqgamxouhtr3a.jpg","al