ellers, long stays, trekkers. See other stays in Bhagsu if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for Loopin McLeodganj?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in Bhagsu."}]'::jsonb, '14:00', '10:00', 'No pets allowed.', 'Smoking is permitted only in designated smoking areas.', NULL, 'budget', '["Guest kitchen for self-catering","Valley views from the property","Pool table and relaxed common area","Luggage storage for trekkers"]'::jsonb, '["Backpackers","Solo travellers","Long stays","Trekkers"]'::jsonb, '["Bhagsunag Temple -- approx 10 min walk","Bhagsu Waterfall -- approx 15 min walk","Dharamkot village -- approx 25 min walk","McLeod Ganj main square -- approx 2.5 km"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'https://www.hostelworld.com/hostels/p/338950/loopin-mcleodganj/', 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://www.hostelworld.com/hostels/p/338950/loopin-mcleodganj/', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('zostel-dharamkot-upper-bhagsu', 'Zostel Dharamkot', 'hostel', 'published', 'directory', 'Despite carrying the Dharamkot name, this Zostel property is listed at Upper Bhagsu Nag, on the slope that links Bhagsu with Dharamkot village. That location works well: you are a short walk from the Bhagsu cafes and waterfall, and within reach of Dharamkot and the Gallu Devi trail towards Triund.

Guests regularly mention clean rooms and well-used common spaces, along with board games and a TV area for downtime on rainy afternoons. There is a 24-hour reception, a travel desk for arranging treks and taxis, luggage storage and free parking, which is useful if you arrive by bike or car. Like most Zostels, the crowd skews young and social, and some reviewers note it can get noisy at busy times, so light sleepers may prefer a private room. It is a solid base for first-time visitors who want the hostel experience with a recognisable brand behind it.', 'Popular Zostel hostel on the Upper Bhagsu hillside towards Dharamkot, known for clean rooms, lively common areas and helpful staff.', 'bhagsu', 'Upper Bhagsu (on the Dharamkot side)', 'Upper Bhagsu (on the Dharamkot side)', 'Bhagsu', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["Free Wi-Fi","Free parking","Luggage storage","24-hour reception","Travel desk","Housekeeping","Board games","Cable TV","WiFi","Cafe","Parking","Power backup","Hot water","Lockers","Common area","Indoor games","Pool table","Rooftop","Lift","Daily housekeeping","Laundry (extra)","Bonfire","Water dispenser","Mountain view"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://proxy.cdn.zostel.com/zostel/gallery/images/BQ_oi4NCSz60SW56L88_8Q/zostel-dharamkot-bhagsu-20260228084614.jpg?format=jpg&w=1200","alt":"Zostel Dharamkot (Bhagsu) building lit up at dusk on the hillside","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://proxy.cdn.zostel.com/zostel/gallery/images/N1wJS9ntRCGO4zBSWLPx4Q/zostel-dharamkot-bhagsu-20260228084611.jpg?format=jpg&w=1200","alt":"Zostel Dharamkot (Bhagsu) above the Bhagsu hillside at sunset","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://proxy.cdn.zostel.com/zostel/gallery/images/XtsZuiMYQL6S2_fuFieo0g/zostel-bhagsu-20260310182359.jpg?format=jpg&w=1200","alt":"Cafe terrace with wicker seating at Zostel Dharamkot (Bhagsu)","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://proxy.cdn.zostel.com/zost