('white-rabbit-guest-house-bhagsu', 'White Rabbit Guest House', 'guesthouse', 'published', 'directory', 'White Rabbit is a small guesthouse of around half a dozen rooms, tucked at the end of a quiet lane just off the main Bhagsu road. It is run by a husband-and-wife team whose hospitality comes up again and again in guest reviews, and it has quietly held a near-perfect reputation for years.

Rooms are kept very clean and come with private bathrooms and mountain views. The top floor has a rooftop restaurant where breakfast is a highlight, with a menu that leans European with Indian touches. It suits couples, solo travellers and slow travellers who want somewhere calm to come back to after a day in the cafes or on the trails, without the hostel crowd. Vehicles cannot reach the door, so expect to use paid public parking nearby and walk the last stretch. The waterfall, the Bhagsunag temple and the footpath up to Dharamkot are all within easy walking distance.', 'Small, family-run Upper Bhagsu guesthouse on a quiet lane, praised for spotless rooms, warm hosts and its rooftop restaurant.', 'bhagsu', 'Upper Bhagsu', 'Upper Bhagsu', 'Bhagsu', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["Free Wi-Fi","Rooftop restaurant","Room service","Laundry service","Private bathrooms","24-hour check-in","WiFi","Restaurant","Breakfast","Non-smoking rooms","Mountain view"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/332180091.jpg?k=a99414834550a2520bc9f0086c22d3faa64d42a2ff30aed12c4ab7b5693f0063&o=","alt":"Orange White Rabbit Guest House building with blue windows and rooftop restaurant, Upper Bhagsu","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/832450893.jpg?k=0636f822422779c37cc3909170151dbfa8e3ef08a50e6491b227f34da68ed230&o=","alt":"White Rabbit Guest House with its covered rooftop restaurant among the trees, Upper Bhagsu","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/332193887.jpg?k=6e4e09eff4b061bbeb7a869617f1382803edc5793c090d9e8960d0f2ac935805&o=","alt":"Double room with exposed-brick wall and balcony at White Rabbit Guest House, Bhagsu","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/332193743.jpg?k=63d49e7cf7b46c118c4360a3f8f041117cfde54592cc0354caac1de3be567033&o=","alt":"Double room with en-suite bathroom at White Rabbit Guest House, Bhagsu","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/332193932.jpg?k=36213ca6f52e9ead6b047936bb1273ae5badd087ffc4b16efb31184295f0e57b&o=","alt":"Brick-walled double room with wall shelves at White Rabbit Guest House, Bhagsu","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4},{"url":"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/332180335.jpg?k=7a1e87f64ec92bd2443a46911fd4e8db476be217128778104940d270adde158b&o=","alt":"Bed with warm lighting and brick headboard wall at White Rabbit Guest House, Bhagsu","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":5},{"url":"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/332180396.jpg?k=6397780f322e717856b00a0fd1802d5128c719c76843d2d75ce1648c344cc300&o=","alt":"Tea tray and kettle by the window in a room at White Rabbit Guest House, Bhagsu","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":6},{"url":"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/332334568.jpg?k=fd166c5baa2e8e55cb74e2b9aef5b85f0ae7a336370c9368241e5b426b52ac95&o=","alt":"Valley view through the balcony door at White Rabbit Guest House, Bhagsu","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":7},{"url":"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/332334979.jpg?k=04bbbf53394e5caa2c931b643ad66ed5cb4d4676722bb558e70eed1dee045c2a&o=","alt":"Morning view over the Kangra valley from White Rabbit Guest House, Bhagsu","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":8}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is White Rabbit Guest House located?","answer":"White Rabbit Guest House is in Upper Bhagsu. Nearby: Bhagsunag Temple -- approx 5 min walk; Bhagsu Waterfall -- approx 10 min walk."},{"question":"What are the check-in and check-out times at White Rabbit Guest House?","answer":"Check-in is from 13:00 and check-out is by 11:00. Confirm early check-in or late check-out when you enquire."},{"question":"Who is White Rabbit Guest House best for?","answer":"It suits couples, solo travellers, slow travellers. See other stays in Bhagsu if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for White Rabbit Guest House?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in Bhagsu."}]'::jsonb, '13:00', '11:00', 'Pets are not allowed.', 'Smoking is not allowed.', NULL, 'budget', '["Only a handful of rooms, so it stays peaceful","Rooftop restaurant with mountain views","Long-standing family hosts","Quiet lane off the main Bhagsu road"]'::jsonb, '["Couples","Solo travellers","Slow travellers"]'::jsonb, '["Bhagsunag Temple -- approx 5 min walk","Bhagsu Waterfall -- approx 10 min walk","Dharamkot village -- approx 20 min walk","McLeod Ganj main square -- approx 2 km"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'https://www.booking.com/hotel/in/white-rabbit-guest-house-dharamshala.html', 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g12486963-d7916978-Reviews-White_Rabbit_Guest_House-Bhagsu_Nag_Dharamsala_Kangra_District_Himachal_Pradesh.html', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('hotel-shivaay-grand-bhagsu', 'Hotel Shivaay Morex', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'Hotel Shivaay Morex (listed on some sites as Shivaay Grand) is a straightforward, well-run hotel on Bhagsunag Road near the Vaishnodevi temple, a few minutes on foot from the Bhagsunag temple and the start of the waterfall walk. It is one of the most consistently well-reviewed hotels in Bhagsu, with guests often pointing to the size and cleanliness of the rooms and the attentive staff.

The in-house restaurant is purely vegetarian and is known for home-style cooking, including local Himachali dishes; non-vegetarians will need to eat out, which is easy given the number of cafes nearby. Rooms come with air conditioning, a TV, a kettle and housekeeping, and some have balconies facing the hills. There is free parking, which is not a given in Bhagsu, plus a 24-hour front desk. It is a sensible pick for families and couples who want hotel comforts at a modest budget and a location close to the action.', 'Good-value vegetarian hotel on Bhagsunag Road, close to the temple, with spacious rooms, mountain-facing balconies and home-style food.', 'bhagsu', 'Bhagsunag Road', 'Bhagsunag Road', 'Bhagsu', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["Free Wi-Fi","Free parking","Restaurant (vegetarian)","Room service","Air conditioning","Kettle","TV","24-hour front desk","CCTV","WiFi","Restaurant","Lift","Heating","LED TV","Laundry","Luggage storage","Tour desk","Housekeeping"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://images.trvl-media.com/lodging/93000000/92490000/92489700/92489648/36e7c2ed.jpg?impolicy=resizecrop&rw=1200&ra=fit","alt":"Hotel Shivaay Grand building (signboard showing its earlier name, Shivaay Morex) beside the temple on Bhagsunag Road","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://images.trvl-media.com/lodging/93000000/92490000/92489700/92489648/bce084ae.jpg?impolicy=resizecrop&rw=1200&ra=fit","alt":"Reception and lobby at Hotel Shivaay Grand, Bhagsu","category":"lobby","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://images.trvl-media.com/lodging/93000000/92490000/92489700/92489648/e8615100.jpg?impolicy=resizecrop&rw=1200&ra=fit","alt":"Room with blue velvet sofas and hill-view windows at Hotel Shivaay Grand, Bhagsu","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://images.trvl-media.com/lodging/93000000/92490000/92489700/92489648/37dc2866.jpg?impolicy=resizecrop&rw=1200&ra=fit","alt":"King room with valley-view balcony door at Hotel Shi