('regenta-inn-luxinna-heights-bhagsu', 'Regenta Inn Luxinna Heights', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'Luxinna Heights is part of the Regenta brand from Royal Orchid Hotels, and it brings chain-hotel consistency to Bhagsunag. The property has around 28 rooms, and the room categories are built around private balconies looking out over the wooded valley, which is the main reason to choose it.

The open rooftop terrace is used for meals and occasional barbecue evenings, and there is an in-house restaurant, room service, a lift and free parking, which matters in a village where parking is tight. Guests tend to praise the service and the food, though a few mention that some rooms feel compact. It suits families, couples and travellers who prefer a known hotel brand with predictable standards over a guesthouse. The location is practical: the Bhagsunag temple is only a few minutes away on foot, and the Bhagsu cafes and waterfall trail are close by.', 'Branded mid-range hotel in Bhagsunag run under Royal Orchid''s Regenta label, with balcony rooms and a rooftop terrace facing the hills.', 'bhagsu', 'Bhagsunag', 'Bhagsunag', 'Bhagsu', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["Free Wi-Fi","Free parking","Restaurant","Rooftop terrace","Room service","Elevator","24-hour front desk","Laundry service","WiFi","Lift","Air conditioning","Heater","Airport transfer","Balcony","Mountain view"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://pix8.agoda.net/hotelImages/42105358/-1/3cfdbe54dd918c6c0494b64ac8cc81cd.jpg?va=1&ce=0&s=1024x768","alt":"Regenta Inn Luxinna Heights building with Regenta Inn signage, Bhagsunag","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://pix8.agoda.net/property/42105358/0/81094e108c7ec34e9e3579fd42204fee.jpeg?va=1&ce=0&s=1024x768","alt":"Five-storey facade with balconies at Regenta Inn Luxinna Heights, Bhagsunag","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://pix8.agoda.net/hotelImages/42105358/-1/a568ca61cf6152ad155e417ab0233485.jpg?va=1&ce=0&s=1024x768","alt":"Premium balcony room with valley view at Regenta Inn Luxinna Heights, Bhagsunag","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://pix8.agoda.net/hotelImages/42105358/-1/986283396794ddd928b1af23f6ee4e03.jpg?va=1&ce=0&s=1024x768","alt":"Studio balcony guest room at Regenta Inn Luxinna Heights, Bhagsunag","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url