('young-monk-hostel-upper-dharamkot', 'Young Monk Hostel', 'hostel', 'published', 'directory', 'Young Monk sits high in Upper Dharamkot, close to where the village thins out into forest, yet it is still on a motorable road, which makes arrivals easier than at many places up here. The hostel is split across two wings, offering standard and deluxe private rooms alongside dormitories, so it works for both budget backpackers and couples who want their own space.

The standout feature is the cafe-restaurant, which has a wide, open view across the Himalayan ridges and the valley and is open to non-guests as well. Recent guests highlight the welcoming owners, clean rooms, filtered drinking water and a balcony area used for yoga. It suits travellers who want quiet, nature and a short walk to the Gallu Devi trailhead for Triund, while keeping Dharamkot''s cafes and yoga studios within reach. A book exchange and travel desk round out the practical side.', 'Upper Dharamkot hostel with private rooms and dorms across two wings, plus a cafe known for its sweeping Himalayan views.', 'dharamkot', 'Upper Dharamkot', 'Upper Dharamkot', 'Dharamkot', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["Free Wi-Fi","Cafe-restaurant","Luggage storage","Travel desk","Housekeeping","Book exchange","WiFi","Cafe","Restaurant","Outdoor terrace","Common room","Games room","Linen included","24-hour security","Mountain view"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1200/v1/propertyimages/3/315846/lm5vc6hrtldspzuss9ah","alt":"Young Monk Hostel building on the Upper Dharamkot hillside","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1200/v1/propertyimages/3/315846/l5sqadjhfzria94efiar","alt":"Yellow second wing of Young Monk Hostel among the pines, Upper Dharamkot","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1200/v1/propertyimages/3/315846/k1ezor2illagwah0yoju","alt":"Front of Young Monk Hostel with terrace and spiral stairs, Upper Dharamkot","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1200/v1/propertyimages/3/315846/ranjl79pdifrf5vjguio","alt":"Reception desk with Young Monk Hostel sign and Tibetan prayer flags, Upper Dharamkot","category":"lobby","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w