packers Dharamkot is in Upper Dharamkot. Nearby: Dharamkot Meditation Point -- approx 5 min walk; Gallu Devi Temple (Triund trailhead) -- approx 25 min walk."},{"question":"What are the check-in and check-out times at Shalom Backpackers Dharamkot?","answer":"Check-in is from 13:00 and check-out is by 11:00. Confirm early check-in or late check-out when you enquire."},{"question":"Who is Shalom Backpackers Dharamkot best for?","answer":"It suits solo female travellers, couples, backpackers, trekkers. See other stays in Dharamkot if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for Shalom Backpackers Dharamkot?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in Dharamkot."}]'::jsonb, '13:00', '11:00', NULL, 'Designated smoking area.', NULL, 'budget', '["Female-only dorm with ensuite and balcony","Balcony doubles and a garden-view cottage","Table tennis room and garden","Quiet upper-village location"]'::jsonb, '["Solo female travellers","Couples","Backpackers","Trekkers"]'::jsonb, '["Dharamkot Meditation Point -- approx 5 min walk","Gallu Devi Temple (Triund trailhead) -- approx 25 min walk","Bhagsu Waterfall -- approx 35 min walk","McLeod Ganj main square -- approx 4 km"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'https://us.trip.com/hotels/kangra-hotel-detail-106623765/shalom-backpackers-dharamkot-mcleodganj/', 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://nz.trip.com/hotels/kangra-hotel-detail-106623765/shalom-backpackers-dharamkot-mcleodganj , https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotels-g4262918-Dharamkot_Dharamsala_Kangra_District_Himachal_Pradesh-Hotels.html', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('eevolve-eco-hostel-dharamkot', 'Eevolve Dharamkot', 'hostel', 'published', 'directory', 'Eevolve was set up by a group of outdoor enthusiasts as a low-impact, budget-friendly hostel, and it sits in a stand of conifers along Dharamkot Road. The surroundings are green and quiet, yet the village''s yoga schools, meditation centres and cafes are close at hand, which is exactly why many guests end up staying longer than planned.

Recent reviews consistently praise the in-house cafe, the comfortable beds, the clean rooms and staff who make the place feel like a home rather than a hotel. There is a coworking space and Wi-Fi for anyone working remotely, free parking, luggage storage and a 24-hour reception. It is a strong choice for solo travellers, digital nomads and anyone in Dharamkot for a yoga or meditation course. The Tushita area, Dharamkot village and the trails up towards Gallu Devi are all comfortable walks, and Bhagsu is a short downhill stroll.', 'Eco-minded hostel in a conifer grove on Dharamkot Road, loved for its cafe food, coworking corner and family-style staff.', 'dharamkot', 'Dharamkot Road', 'Dharamkot Road', 'Dharamkot', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["Free Wi-Fi","Cafe","Coworking space","Free parking","Luggage storage","24-hour reception","Airport transfers (on request)","WiFi","Hot water","Garden","Outdoor terrace","Mountain view","Laundry facilities","Bicycle hire","Airport transfer","Lockers","Common room"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1200/v1/propertyimages/3/319000/vxrqosatwaxok6tqczmh","alt":"Eevolve Dharamkot hostel building in the conifer forest on Dharamkot Road","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1200/v1/propertyimages/3/319000/ebn64glk1aronn1iaw4y","alt":"Stone-paved courtyard and covered seating at Eevolve Dharamkot","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1200/v1/propertyimages/3/319000/hp6ngkupundjmilofcic","alt":"Garden terrace with mountain view and prayer flags at Eevolve Dharamkot","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1200/v1/propertyimages/3/319000/jf1jgv1fievsoro48ykf","alt":"Glass-roofed common lounge at Eevolve Dharamkot hostel","category":"amenity","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1200/v1/propertyimages/3/319000/rgnm64j8ppbrszrdey4d","alt":"Private double room with forest-facing window at Eevolve Dharamkot","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1200/v1/propertyimages/3/319000/agty5mzsokhqlef3sbmy","alt":"Spacious private room with double bed at Eevolve Dharamkot","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":5},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1200/v1/propertyimages/3/319000/dtbgujdngfxoadyaxldm","alt":"Twin private room at Eevolve Dharamkot hostel","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":6},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1200/v1/propertyimages/3/319000/qfhbuajbglotoavciunq","alt":"Dormitory with bunk beds and window seat at Eevolve Dharamkot","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":7},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1200/v1/propertyimages/3/319000/rt5heipcmyclfasibuc7","alt":"Tiled shower room at Eevolve Dharamkot hostel","category":"bathroom","is_primary":false,"sort_order":8}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is Eevolve Dharamkot located?","answer":"Eevolve Dharamkot is in Dharamkot Road. Nearby: Dharamkot village centre -- approx 10 min walk; Tushita Meditation Centre -- approx 15 min walk."},{"question":"What are the check-in and check-out times at Eevolve Dharamkot?","answer":"Check-in is from 13:00 and check-out is by 11:00. Confirm early check-in or late check-out when you enquire."},{"question":"Who is Eevolve Dharamkot best for?","answer":"It suits remote workers, solo travellers, yoga and meditation students, backpackers. See other stays in Dharamkot if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for Eevolve Dharamkot?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in Dharamkot."}]'::jsonb, '13:00', '11:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'budget', '["Eco-conscious hostel in a conifer forest","Highly rated in-house cafe","Coworking space for remote workers","Close to Dharamkot yoga and meditation centres"]'::jsonb, '["Remote workers","Solo travellers","Yoga and meditation students","Backpackers"]'::jsonb, '["Dharamkot village centre -- approx 10 min walk","Tushita Meditation Centre -- approx 15 min walk","Bhagsu Waterfall -- approx 30 min walk","McLeod Ganj main square -- approx 3 km"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'https://www.hostelworld.com/hostels/p/319000/eevolve/', 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://www.hostelworld.com/hostels/p/319000/eevolve/ , https://www.kayak.co.in/Dharamshala-Hotels-Eevolve-Dharamkot---An-Eco-Hostel.9553571.ksp', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('mustard-house-homestay-dharamkot', 'Mustard House - Travellers Homestay', 'homestay', 'published', 'directory', 'Mustard House is a true homestay rather than a guesthouse: the host lives on site, cooks for guests and is happy to help plan days out. There are just five bright rooms, so the house rarely feels busy, and guests often end up sharing tips and meals with one another.

It is tucked away in a quieter pocket of Dharamkot off the road towards Bhagsunag, close to an Ayurveda centre and within walking distance of the village''s cafes. Breakfast is included, and recent guests speak warmly of the home-cooked food and of the host''s small homemade pickle venture. Yoga sessions and bicycle hire are offered, and there is free parking, which is helpful in an area where cars often cannot get close. It is well suited to solo travellers, women travelling alone and families who prefer a home environment over a hotel. The Bhagsu waterfall and the Triund trail are both reachable on foot.', 'Five-room host-run homestay in a quiet corner of Dharamkot, with breakfast included, home cooking and a genuinely personal welcome.', 'dharamkot', 'Lower Dharamkot (Bhagsunag Road side)', 'Lower Dharamkot (Bhagsunag Road side)', 'Dharamkot', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["Free Wi-Fi","Free parking","Breakfast included","Yoga classes","Bicycle rental"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is Mustard House - Travellers Homestay located?","answer":"Mustard House - Travellers Homestay is in Lower Dharamkot (Bhagsunag Road side). Nearby: Dharamkot village centre -- approx 10 min walk; Bhagsunag Temple -- approx 15 min walk."},{"question":"Who is Mustard House - Travellers Homestay best for?","answer":"It suits solo female travellers, families, slow travellers. See other stays in Dharamkot if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for Mustard House - Travellers Homestay?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in Dharamkot."}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'budget', '["Only five rooms, run by a live-in host","Breakfast included and home-cooked meals","Yoga sessions offered","Free parking"]'::jsonb, '["Solo female travellers","Families","Slow travellers"]'::jsonb, '["Dharamkot village centre -- approx 10 min walk","Bhagsunag Temple -- approx 15 min walk","Bhagsu Waterfall -- approx 20 min walk","McLeod Ganj main square -- approx 3 km"]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://www.tripadvisor.in/Hotel_Review-g4262918-d26790091-Reviews-Mustard_House_Travellers_Homestay-Dharamkot_Dharamsala_Kangra_District_Himachal_Prad.html. No verified own photos yet -- page shows an area photo.', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('mastiff-select-mandavya-dharamkot', 'Mastiff Select Mandavya Dharamkot', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'Mandavya, part of the Mastiff Select collection, has quickly become one of the best-reviewed hotels around Dharamkot. It sits on the Bhagsunag road below the main village, so it is easy to reach by car while still being a short walk from the Bhagsu temple area and a steady uphill stroll from Dharamkot''s cafes.

Guests most often mention the design of the property, the views over the valley and mountains, spotless rooms and staff who go out of their way to help. The in-house restaurant, Tangelo, also gets frequent praise for both taste and presentation. Breakfast is included, rooms have air conditioning, and the hotel is pet friendly, which is still unusual in the area. It suits couples, families and travellers with dogs who want comfortable, modern rooms without moving up to luxury-resort prices. A few reviewers mention occasional noise, so ask for a quieter room if that matters.', 'Stylish, pet-friendly hotel on the Bhagsu-Dharamkot road with valley views, an in-house restaurant and consistently excellent service reviews.', 'dharamkot', 'Lower Dharamkot (Bhagsunag Road)', 'Lower Dharamkot (Bhagsunag Road)', 'Dharamkot', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["Free Wi-Fi","Free parking","Restaurant","Breakfast included","Room service","Air conditioning","Pet friendly","Airport transfers (on request)","WiFi","Cafe","Swimming pool","Lift","Laundry service","Concierge","Luggage storage","24-hour front desk","Balcony"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0224x12000sbytgh2F616_W_1080_808_R5_Q80.jpg","alt":"Mastiff Select Mandavya hotel building on the forested hillside, Dharamkot","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0221o12000lz7m7rz4B44_W_1080_808_R5_Q80.jpg","alt":"Mastiff Select Mandavya lit up at night among the deodars, Dharamkot","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/1ik0h12000o3tth871A25_W_1080_808_R5_Q80.jpg","alt":"Pool deck with Mastiff Select signage at Mandavya, Dharamkot","category":"pool","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0227112000m5kuxbdE55B_W_1080_808_R5_Q80.jpg","alt":"Outdoor swimming pool facing the cedar forest at Mastiff Select Mandavya","category":"pool","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"htt