('hyatt-regency-dharamshala-resort-dharamkot', 'Hyatt Regency Dharamshala Resort', 'resort', 'published', 'directory', 'The Hyatt Regency is the area''s largest luxury option, set in a forested pocket of Dharamkot at roughly 2,000 metres. Around 80 keys are spread across rooms, club rooms, a few suites and private villas, many of them looking out over deodar slopes towards the Kangra Valley.

Facilities are what you would expect from an international brand: a multi-cuisine restaurant that features Tibetan and Himachali dishes alongside global food, a bar, the Shanti spa, a meditation space and a heated pool that guests often mention as a highlight in the cooler months. Service is generally praised, though some reviewers feel prices are steep for what they get. It is best for couples on a special trip, families wanting resort comforts, and travellers who prefer a self-contained base and are happy to take a taxi into McLeod Ganj or to trailheads. It is not a place to walk out of into cafe lanes, so factor in short drives.', 'International luxury resort hidden in Dharamkot''s deodar forest, with villas, a heated pool, a spa and wide Kangra Valley views.', 'dharamkot', 'Dharamkot (forest belt below the village)', 'Dharamkot (forest belt below the village)', 'Dharamkot', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["Wi-Fi","Heated swimming pool","Spa","Restaurant","Bar","Meditation space","WiFi","Free parking","Valet parking","Room service","Indoor swimming pool","Gym","Yoga room","Kids club","Lift","Garden","Airport transfer","24-hour front desk"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://pix8.agoda.net/hotelImages/46045029/0/38fd8df4f008ca08d8cef376ea3a364c.jpeg?va=1&ce=0&s=1024x768","alt":"Main building and driveway of Hyatt Regency Dharamshala Resort at dusk, Dharamkot","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://pix8.agoda.net/hotelImages/9389911/0/b6aca0de660e0b7d4a811bdf0d631a7f.jpeg?va=1&s=1024x768","alt":"Aerial view of Hyatt Regency Dharamshala Resort in the deodar forest above the Kangra Valley","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://pix8.agoda.net/hotelImages/46045029/0/7864e5592e847b046dd38181afb16aa8.jpeg?va=1&ce=0&s=1024x768","alt":"Entrance court of Hyatt Regency Dharamshala Resort among cedar trees, Dharamkot","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://q-xx.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max10