('chonor-house-temple-road-mcleod-ganj', 'Chonor House', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'Chonor House is run by the Norbulingka Institute, the organisation that works to keep traditional Tibetan arts alive, and that connection shows in every room. Each one is themed around a different aspect of Tibet, from its regions to its plants and animals, with hand-painted murals, carved furniture and woven rugs made by Norbulingka artisans. The building itself was designed by architect David Porter to sit quietly among the cedars on the hillside.

It lies on a narrow lane off Temple Road, only a few minutes'' walk from the Tsuglagkhang complex and the Tibet Museum, yet it feels removed from the bustle of the main bazaar. Many rooms have balconies, and the restaurant and garden courtyard serve Tibetan dishes alongside Indian and continental options. It suits culturally curious travellers and couples. Be aware that the approach is steep with steps, which can be hard for anyone with limited mobility or heavy luggage.', 'Boutique guesthouse run by the Norbulingka Institute on Temple Road, where each room is decorated with Tibetan murals and handmade furnishings.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Temple Road', 'Temple Road', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["Free Wi-Fi","Restaurant","Breakfast","Garden courtyard","Laundry service","Taxi service","WiFi","Free parking","Room service","Garden","Massage room","Conference room","Tour desk","24-hour front desk","Air conditioning"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0223312000k7b2c8s75DB_W_1080_808_R5_Q80.jpg","alt":"Chonor House building with Tibetan window motifs and prayer flags among cedars, McLeod Ganj","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/1ik1v12000t8vf43w8BF6_W_1080_808_R5_Q80.jpg","alt":"Balconied facade of Chonor House seen through the cedar trees, Temple Road","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://norbulingka.org/cdn/shop/files/chonor-house-25x9.jpg?v=1714467728&width=1600","alt":"Twin room with hand-painted Tibetan murals at Chonor House, McLeod Ganj","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0220112000k3bm9fx85B6_W_1080_808_R5_Q80.jpg","alt":"Themed guest room with lake and bird murals at Chonor House, McLeod Ganj","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0226z12000k7b2i8014B6_W_1080_808_R5_Q80.jpg","alt":"Twin room decorated with Tibetan landscape murals at Chonor House","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0221712000k7b1zmh083C_W_1080_808_R5_Q80.jpg","alt":"Tibetan painted cabinet and artwork by Norbulingka artisans at Chonor House","category":"other","is_primary":false,"sort_order":5},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0222p12000k7b25n27C06_W_1080_808_R5_Q80.jpg","alt":"Garden courtyard dining area at Chonor House, McLeod Ganj","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":6},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0225c12000k7b2gof759D_W_1080_808_R5_Q80.jpg","alt":"Sunlit dining room with long wooden table at Chonor House","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":7},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/02X4n12000dvua5ll4D3C_W_1080_808_R5_Q80.jpg","alt":"Restaurant with Tibetan murals at Chonor House, McLeod Ganj","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":8},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0220n12000k7b2gtt8843_W_1080_808_R5_Q80.jpg","alt":"Lounge with Tibetan-style screens and bamboo-print cushions at Chonor House","category":"lobby","is_primary":false,"sort_order":9}]'::jsonb, '[{"name":"Superior Double or Twin Room","description":"Individually themed room with Tibetan murals.","bed_type":"Twin","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Premium Room","description":"Individually themed room decorated by Norbulingka artisans.","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Suite Room","description":"Suite with one queen bed and two single beds.","bed_type":"Queen + 2 single","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true}]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is Chonor House located?","answer":"Chonor House is in Temple Road. Nearby: Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- approx 3-5 min walk; Tibet Museum -- approx 3-5 min walk."},{"quest