pprox 10-15 min walk","Tushita Meditation Centre -- approx 15 min walk","Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- approx 20 min walk","Dal Lake -- approx 3 km"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'https://www.glenmoorcottages.com/', 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1092107-d421419-Reviews-Glenmoor_Cottages-McLeod_Ganj_Dharamsala_Kangra_District_Himachal_Pradesh.html', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('fortune-park-moksha-satobari', 'Fortune Park Moksha', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'Fortune Park Moksha, a member of the ITC Hotels group, stands on Strawberry Hills at Satobari, close to Dal Lake and roughly 5 km from McLeod Ganj''s main square. The pine and deodar setting is noticeably calmer than town, and most rooms have large balconies looking out over the Kangra Valley.

The hotel has around 60 rooms, a restaurant, a spa, a swimming pool and a gym, and breakfast is generally included. Guests regularly praise the staff, cleanliness and food, and the hotel has a long track record with well over a thousand reviews. It is a good match for families, couples and older travellers who want full-service comforts and a quiet base, especially for trips that combine Dal Lake, Naddi and the Tibetan Children''s Village side of the hills. The trade-off is location: it is not walkable to the bazaar, so plan on taxis or your own vehicle for getting around.', 'ITC-group hotel at Satobari near Dal Lake, with balcony rooms, a pool, a spa and wide valley views, about 5 km from McLeod Ganj.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Satobari, near Dal Lake', 'Satobari, near Dal Lake', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["Free Wi-Fi","Free parking","Swimming pool","Spa","Gym","Restaurant","Breakfast included","Room service","Babysitting","WiFi","Outdoor swimming pool","Sauna","Bar","Lift","Game room","Air conditioning","Balcony","Airport transfer","24-hour front desk"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://pix8.agoda.net/hotelImages/782079/0/8d07d5c1c90a6ae40bced2374916bbef.jpeg?va=1&ce=3&s=1024x768","alt":"Fortune Park Moksha building on the forested Strawberry Hills, Satobari","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://pix8.agoda.net/hotelImages/782079/0/207a725748ebd5adf8a0c21442ab40e7.jpeg?va=1&ce=3&s=1024x768","alt":"Hillside blocks and terraces of Fortune Park Moksha, Satobari near Dal Lake","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://pix8.agoda.net/hotelImages/782079/708429034/bdba9a4c5cb67775c6839d757cc5cdc9.jpeg?va=1&ce=3&s=1024x768","alt":"Deluxe nature-view suite bedroom at Fortune Park Moksha, McLeod Ganj","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://q-xx.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/865774127.jpg?k=c35de9888bfd0d8401f591cc6c5226041bf39cb9bd76abcd804f17c011d04c4e&o=","alt":"Spacious 